    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document describes the &quot;about&quot; URI scheme, which is widely used
by Web browsers and some other applications to designate access to
their internal resources, such as settings, application information,
hidden built-in functionality, and so on.</t>
    </abstract>
